() Tj T*
(Document ID: SOP-SAFE-002) Tj T*
(Document Type: sop) Tj T*
(Revision: Rev 2.1) Tj T*
(Effective Date: 2026-02-01) Tj T*
(Department: Health, Safety & Environment \(HSE\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Mandatory Personal Protective Equipment \(PPE\)) Tj T*
(All personnel entering rotating equipment areas and operating units must wear:) Tj T*
(  - Industrial safety helmet \(EN 397 certified\)) Tj T*
(  - Steel-toe boots with puncture-resistant soles) Tj T*
(  - High-visibility safety vest) Tj T*
(  - Safety glasses with side shields) Tj T*
(  - Heat-resistant gloves when inspecting hot surfaces) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Emergency Isolation and Shutdown Procedure) Tj T*
(In case of fire, bearing seizure, or catastrophic equipment vibration:) Tj T*
(  1. Depress the nearest emergency trip button immediately.) Tj T*
(  2. Evacuate non-essential personnel to the designated muster point.) Tj T*
(  3. Notify the central control room via direct radio channel 4.) Tj T*
(  4. Do not re-enter the area until cleared by the safety officer.) Tj T*
ET
