BT /F1 11 Tf 50 740 Td 15 TL (STANDARD OPERATING PROCEDURE  INDUSTRIAL PLANT SAFETY & ISOLATION) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Document ID: SOP-SAFE-002 \(Page 2\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. Lockout/Tagout \(LOTO\) Procedure) Tj T*
(Before performing any mechanical or electrical maintenance on rotating machinery:) Tj T*
(  1. Identify all electrical, hydraulic, and pneumatic energy sources.) Tj T*
(  2. Notify operations supervisor and affected shift personnel.) Tj T*
(  3. Open circuit breakers and isolate feed valves.) Tj T*
(  4. Apply standardized LOTO padlock and danger warning tag.) Tj T*
(  5. Verify zero energy state using voltage detector and manual rotation check.) Tj T*
(  6. Maintain lockout key in authorized lockbox during entire work duration.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
